[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833418208","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105775#issuecomment-2833418208","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105775","id":2833418208,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o4ofg","user":{"login":"Alex-Onceanu","id":85576612,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NTc2NjEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85576612?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex-Onceanu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-27T11:50:58Z","updated_at":"2025-04-27T11:50:58Z","body":"Can confirm on Godot v4.5.dev (a77a28c02) - macOS Sequoia (15.1.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M2 Pro - Apple M2 Pro (10 threads).\n\nThe issue seems to be coming specifically from the \"right\" and \"bottom\" limits, which both have an offset that doesn't match the ones set in \"limit\". When the rotation of the camera is between close to 0 degrees, this offset is camera size / 2 (so width/2 for \"right\", height/2 for \"bottom\", which is only correct when the rotation is 0, but it's too low when the rotation is a bit more than 0 degrees). \n\nWhen the rotation property exceeds a certain threshold (which - again - depends on the limit), the offset for the \"right\"/\"bottom\" limit adapts in order to barely touch the border of the camera. It gradually goes to around the triple of the initial offset (which is way too much). \n\nSo there must be a math error in the code for Camera2d's limit, where we compute the offset's new limit depending on the camera's rotation.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833418208/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833420575","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105775#issuecomment-2833420575","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105775","id":2833420575,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o4pEf","user":{"login":"Alex-Onceanu","id":85576612,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NTc2NjEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85576612?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex-Onceanu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-27T11:57:00Z","updated_at":"2025-04-27T11:57:00Z","body":"Also : when both \"position smoothing\" and \"limit smoothing\" are set to true, the issue doesn't occur anymore. Is it expected behaviour ? \nIf not, I can change the camera's limits to behave the same as usual when one of these two is false.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833420575/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833460959","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105775#issuecomment-2833460959","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105775","id":2833460959,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o4y7f","user":{"login":"Alex-Onceanu","id":85576612,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NTc2NjEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85576612?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex-Onceanu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-27T13:29:57Z","updated_at":"2025-04-27T13:29:57Z","body":"I fixed the bug, by clamping the camera's position depending on bottom-right corner of the camera (just as it is with top-left corner for \"top\" and \"left\" limits). Here is the pull request : https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105825/ ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833460959/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]